OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry and settled night with mostly
OL,7,Fcloudy skies, though some clear
OL,8,Fintervals are still possible. Winds
OL,9,Fwill strengthen overnight, especially
OL,10,Faround the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FDry and mostly cloudy start
OL,13,Fwith some brightness. Cloud soon
OL,14,Flowering and thickening with some
OL,15,Flight rain possible through the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Winds strengthening further
OL,17,Fwith gales possible near coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
