OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FStrong
OL,6,Fwinds Wednesday with rain clearing
OL,7,Feast to leave sunny spells and
OL,8,Fshowers. Mostly dry with sunny spells
OL,9,FThursday and winds easing. Cloudy
OL,10,FFriday with rain spreading east.
